### Get Books
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books

### Get Book by Id
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books/3

### Create books
POST {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BookTracker.Token}}

{
  "title": "ikke",
  "author": "Frank Herbert",
  "year": 1965
}

### Delete Book
DELETE {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books/2
Authorization: Bearer {{BookTracker.Token}}

### Update Book
PUT {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BookTracker.Token}}

{
  "title": "Changes",
  "author": "David Bowie",
  "year": 1971,
  "version": "7982e7ee-9cc4-47e2-9ab2-f608aeeb63dc"
}

### Get Books Page 1
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books?page=11&pageSize=51

### Get Books Page 2
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books?page=2&pageSize=10

### Search books
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books?search=octopus&page=6

### Search Books with paging
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/books?search=octopus&page=2&pageSize=10



### Get Members Page 1
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{BookTracker.Token}}

### Get Member
GET {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BookTracker.Token}}

### Create members
POST {{BookTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mats Cools",
  "email": "mats@dings.com",
  "password": "ValidPassword"
}

### Update member
